_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 15
---
order: 15
---
short_label: I.15
---
statement:

If two straight lines cut one another, then they make the vertical angles equal to one another.
<p><b><a href="propI15.html#cor">Corollary.</a></b>
If two straight lines cut one another, then they will make the angles at the point of section equal to four right angles.
---
body:
